{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2021-02-04 14:30:00', 'title': 'MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL DECLARES REGULAR\xa0QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.315 PER SHARE', 'text': 'CHICAGO, FEB. 04, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NASDAQ: MDLZ) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.315 PER SHARE OF CLASS A COMMON STOCK. THIS DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON APRIL 14, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2021.'}